NAME
    gcloud apihub apis versions - manage Version resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub apis versions GROUP | COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Version resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     operations
        Manage Api Operation resources.

     specs
        Manage Spec resources.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Version.

     delete
        Delete a Version.

     describe
        Describe a Version.

     list
        List Versions.

     update
        Update versions.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub apis versions

